<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Northern Fury 34 - The Longest Battle, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Northern Fury 34 - The Longest Battle&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;23 Feb 1994, 1400 Zulu, 1100 Local&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Note:&amp;nbsp; This scenario is huge, and is a work in progress.&amp;nbsp; Please report any issues to the author.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;A week into World War III and your life has changed dramatically.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;As a rather young, newly promoted Rear Admiral (lower half) you were six months into a staff job at the Pentagon, now with a second star on your shoulders, you are in charge of organizing and protecting merchant traffic in the Atlantic! You and your staff of 60 arrived aboard the USS John F. Kennedy 3 days ago in Miami. Fresh after defeating Cuba, Nicaragua and Honduras in an impressive 3-day strike campaign, the Commander and crew of the CVBG is not overly welcoming.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;They want to be part of the campaign to evict the Russians from Iceland, but instead, they have lost 20% of their hanger space to your HQ (a maze of trailers, shelters and tents for both sleeping and working), and traded in two thirds of the Hornets for more Vikings and Sea Kings.&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;Because CINCLANT (VAdm Falkner) is heading north with 4 CVBG’s, 2 BB SAGs and the Amphibs accompanied by the British and French carriers and a couple other SAGs, his flagship and staff are quite busy. (See the Northern Fury background document for more details). Therefore, he directed that the John F. Kennedy (CV-67) reconfigure to conduct Sea Control and command all forces securing the SLOC (Sea Line of Communications) between Europe and North America. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;Your task is to assemble escorts and aircraft from across the Atlantic, organize hundreds of merchant vessels into convoys and defend them from upwards of 60 Soviet submarines! All this while preventing any escalation of the war, and not losing any of your assets!&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-layout-grid-align: none"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;Designer notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;This scenario is designed to be an experiment in long duration scenarios, thus some detail has been sacrificed to enable extended play. (i.e. ship names are replaced with destination)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;The scenario is very easy to ‘game’, you could choose to leave ships in an unload area for the entire duration and collect points.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;If you wish to do so – enjoy.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;The destination of ships is not fixed; any ship unloading in any destination will receive points.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The destinations have been chosen based on an assessment of peacetime traffic volume and a gut feel of how that would proceed in wartime, so this is representational at best.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The intent is to complicate the player’s life (speed &amp;amp; destination) and simulate Trans-Atlantic traffic.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Should you need or want to change destinations, feel free to do so but try not to skew the overall effect.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;There is a low probability every hour that new cargo ships will arrive at about 8 different locations around the AO.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;You will get a message when one does.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;A new feature has been requested that lengthens the time between checks, but it’s every hour on the hour at the moment.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;There are a handful of Hornets from VFA-106 Gladiators at Key West, some F-4 Phantoms at Charleston and even some A-4 Skyhawk’s at Roosevelt Roads and other places. These are all carrier capable and combat ready; however, their main role is training.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;VFA-106 is the Operational Training unit for the F/A-18 on the East Coast, the Phantoms and Skyhawk’s are used for training air defence and in DACT (Dissimilar Air Combat Training).&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;You may wish to base these AC on the JFK but please remember that she is older, less capable and smaller than the CVNs you may be used to working with - and to limit your hanger space by 20%. Recommend you restrict you AC capacity to 60, and she already has 56 on board.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;The shore based F/A-18s, F-4’s and A-4’s all have a primary role, and the entire fleet is either fighting or training at this point in the war; although they would love to get into a scrap, you should limit them to 3-4 days out of 10 on operations. On the up-side, the F-4 &amp;amp; A-4 pilots are mostly ‘Aces’ while the F/A-18’s are a mix of ‘Aces’ &amp;amp; ‘Rookies’.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;You are still at war with Cuba, Nicaragua and Honduras; however, their militaries have largely been defeated in the past week. A detailed intelligence assessment is included in your briefing but a steady watch is what is needed as opposed to a concerted strike operation, which could be harmful to peace negotiations.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;You will be tempted to make strikes into neutral countries (Venezuela, Nigeria, perhaps others).&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;That’s fine, you’re a super-power in a war of national survival; you will have the ability, motive and desire to do so. However, you will receive a hefty VP loss for doing so and will receive no VPs for destroying forces in those countries, and they have been reinforced from historic levels by Soviet client states.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;This may also cause you some unexpected consequences. The payoff may, or may not be worth it.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;Argentina will be a problem for you.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;You gain points for completing the unloading or transfer of merchant and military cargo ships, or sinking Soviet submarines. You lose significant points for losing a warship and losing a Carrier will really hurt. Each merchant will cost you the equivalent of 4 successful trips across the Atlantic. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt 36pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;·&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-font-kerning: 1.5pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-CA; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI'&gt;One main thing you will need to keep track of.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Cargo ships will need to unload for 3 days in an unloading area, or transfer (2 days at Panama and Gibraltar, 1 day at Cape of Good Hope). There is really no way I can think of to help with this, you will just need to keep them organized in the unload or transfer areas so you know which ones are done and can therefore leave. Awkward. You will get a message stating that ‘A ship at XXX has unloaded (or transferred) and is ready for the return journey’.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;By transfer I mean that the original ship has transferred to the convoy control HQ of the appropriate area (Med, PAC, IO), and you have picked up a returning vessel.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This is the&amp;nbsp;34th scenario of a&amp;nbsp;58 scenario campaign. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. Germany still divided, WP still alive and doing very well. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;The 3&lt;SPAN style="POSITION: relative; TOP: -4pt; mso-text-raise: 4.0pt"&gt;rd&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;World war started on 13 Feb 1994. Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting also erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa. India has declared a separate war with Pakistan, North Korea attacked Southwards in an apparently independent move and Argentina is threatening the Falklands again (but has not attacked).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;In earlier scenarios to this battle-set, you found that the defences in North and Central Norway have collapsed; the Soviet Northern Fleet has put to sea; Soviet submarines are inflicting damage along the US Eastern seaboard; and Iceland is now in Soviet hands.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;You should turn 'special messages' ON, and Scenario Events OFF.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;You have some significant ammunition issues, for the full experience you should play with 'Unlimited ammunition OFF'&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Please respect the initial ready times for aircraft.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 6pt 35.35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.15pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;If you sank a major unit in previous scenarios, you may encounter them again.&amp;nbsp; This is a limitation of tactical game played in a campaign such as this.&amp;nbsp; Consider the previous report erroneous and enjoy attacking that unit again. After all – it has been known that reports from units in contact are sometimes exaggerated ;-)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 6pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
